<updatedby><name>CN=Mark Knollin/OU=Reseautique/O=Serti Informatique</name><name>CN=Patrick Juneau/O=Serti Informatique</name><name>CN=Mark Knollin/OU=Reseautique/O=Serti Informatique</name><name>CN=Patrick Beauchamp/OU=Reseautique/O=Serti Informatique</name><name>CN=Developpement Serti/O=Serti Informatique</name><name>CN=Patrick Beauchamp/OU=Reseautique/O=Serti Informatique</name><name>CN=Mark Knollin/OU=Reseautique/O=Serti Informatique</name><name>CN=Developpement Serti/O=Serti Informatique</name><name>CN=Mark Knollin/OU=Reseautique/O=Serti Informatique</name><name>CN=Developpement Serti/O=Serti Informatique</name><name>CN=Mark Knollin/OU=Reseautique/O=Serti Informatique</name><name>CN=Developpement Serti/O=Serti Informatique</name><name>CN=Mark Knollin/OU=Reseautique/O=Serti Informatique</name><name>CN=Developpement Serti/O=Serti Informatique</name><name>CN=Mark Knollin/OU=Reseautique/O=Serti Informatique</name><name>CN=Developpement Serti/O=Serti Informatique</name><name>CN=Mark Knollin/OU=Reseautique/O=Serti Informatique</name><name>CN=Developpement Serti/O=Serti Informatique</name><name>CN=Mark Knollin/OU=Reseautique/O=Serti Informatique</name><name>CN=Developpement Serti/O=Serti Informatique</name><name>CN=Mark Knollin/OU=Reseautique/O=Serti Informatique</name><name>CN=Developpement Serti/O=Serti Informatique</name><name>CN=Mark Knollin/OU=Reseautique/O=Serti Informatique</name><name>CN=Developpement Serti/O=Serti Informatique</name><name>CN=Mark Knollin/OU=Reseautique/O=Serti Informatique</name><name>CN=Developpement Serti/O=Serti Informatique</name><name>CN=Mark Knollin/OU=Reseautique/O=Serti Informatique</name><name>CN=Developpement Serti/O=Serti Informatique</name><name>CN=Emmanuelle Beauchamp/OU=SDS/O=Serti Informatique</name><name>CN=Developpement Serti/O=Serti Informatique</name><name>CN=Patrick Juneau/O=Serti Informatique</name><name>CN=Developpement Serti/O=Serti Informatique</name></updatedby>
<wassignedby><name>CN=Developpement Serti/O=Serti Informatique</name></wassignedby><code event="options"><lotusscript>Option Public
Option Explicit
Use "SI_FichierWIN"
Use "SL_JSON"
Use "SL_JSONWriter"		' ls.snapps.JSONWriter renamed for internal naming standards 

	%REM
	=======================================================================================================================
	Guide d'utilisation
	=======================================================================================================================
	
	La seule classe qu'il faut utiliser est cl_Envelope_SLDS.  Tous les autres éléments sont en soutien de cette classe.
	
	Pour créer une envelope, utilise l'instruction NEW:
		Set v_Envelope = New cl_Envelope_SLDS(p_Environnement, p_Objet As String, p_Message As String)
		-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
		Environnement : P = Production, L = Local, T = Tests  (voir xGDK_TypeNDBCourante)
		L'objet est obligatoire pour pouvoir envoyer l'envelope.
		L'objet et le message sont remplacés par les valeurs du destinataire, si présentes.
		
	Pour ajouter du texte au message de l'envelope, utilise la fonction AjouterMessage:
		Function AjouterMessage(p_Message* As String, p_NbLignesBlanches As Integer) As Boolean
		-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
				
	Pour ajouter un destinataire, utiliser la fonction AjouterDestinataire:
		Function AjouterDestinataire(p_TypeDestinataire* As String, p_Nom* As String, p_Courriel* As String, p_IdDestinataire* As Integer, _
		p_Ordre* As Integer, p_Objet As String, p_Message As String, p_Langue As string) As Boolean
		-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
		Types de destinataires : (S) Signataire/Signer, (R) Lecteur obligatoire/Must read, (C) Copie conforme/Carbon copy, (E) Editeurs/Editor
		L'Id du destinataire est un numéro unique par destinataire.

	Pour ajouter un groupe de destinataires, utiliser la fonction AjouterGroupeDestinataires:
		Public Function AjouterGroupeDestinataires(p_TypeDestinataire* As String, p_IdGroupe* As Long, p_IdDestinataire* As Long, p_Ordre* As Integer, _
		p_Objet As String, p_Message As String, p_Langue As String) As Boolean
		-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
		Types de destinataires : (S) Signataire/Signer, (R) Lecteur obligatoire/Must read, (C) Copie conforme/Carbon copy, (E) Editeurs/Editor
		L'Id du groupe est assigné par DocuSign.
		L'Id du destinataire est un numéro unique par destinataire.
		
	Pour ajouter un document, utiliser la fonction AjouterDocument:
		Function AjouterDocument(p_IdDocument* As Integer, p_CheminAcces* As String) As Boolean
		-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
		L'Id du document est un numéro unique par document.
		Le fichier spécifié dans le chemin d'accès doit exister.

	Pour ajouter une signature à un destinataire, utiliser la fonction AjouterSignature:
		Function AjouterSignature(p_IdDestinataire* As Integer, p_TypeSignature* As String, p_IdDocument* As Integer, p_Signet* As String, _
		p_AjustementX As Integer, p_AjustementY As Integer) As Boolean
		-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
		Le destinataire et le document doivent avoir été ajoutés à l'enveloppe au préalable.
		Types de signature : (S) Signature, (I) Initiales, (DS) Date de signature
		Les ajustements sont indiqués en millimètres.
				
	Pour envoyer l'envelope, utiliser la fonction Envoyer:
		Function Envoyer(p_email* As String, p_Password* As String, p_IntegratorKey* As String, p_Brouillon* As Boolean) As Boolean
		-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
		Si p_Brouillon = True,  l'enveloppe est créée chez DocuSign mais pas envoyée aux destinataires.  Utiliser pour les tests.
		
	***** Exemple d'agent *****
	Dim v_Envelope As cl_Envelope_SLDS
	Set v_Envelope = New cl_Envelope_SLDS("Test " &amp; CStr(Now), "Veuillez signer le contrat çi-joint dans les plus bref délais.")
	If v_Envelope.AjouterDestinataire("S", "Patrick Beauchamp", "pbeauchamp@serti.com", 1, 1, "", "", "FR") Then
		If v_Envelope.AjouterDocument(1, "C:\Users\patrickb\Documents\PP9527.pdf") Then
			If v_Envelope.AjouterSignature(1, "S", 1, "[#S1]", 10, 0) Then
				If v_Envelope.AjouterSignature(1, "I", 1, "[#I1]", 0, 3) Then
					If v_Envelope.AjouterSignature(1, "DS", 1, "[#D1]", 85, 0) Then
						If v_Envelope.Envoyer("email@serti.com", "MotPasse", "5b97d19f-5500-5d58-b5bf-54f3c5d80b82", False) Then
							Print "Envelope " &amp; v_Envelope.Id &amp; " envoyée à " &amp; CStr(v_Envelope.NbDestinataires) &amp; " destinataires."
						End If
					End If
				End If
			End If
		End If
	End if
	
	***** Structure des classes *****
		Envelope
			ListeDestinataires
				ListeDestinatairesType
					Destinataire
						ListeSignatures
							ListeSignaturesType
								Signature
			ListeDocuments
				Document
	=======================================================================================================================
	%END REM


</lotusscript></code><code event="declarations"><lotusscript>' Déclarations globales
' ----------------------------------
Dim gns_SLDS As NotesSession
Dim v_UrlDocuSign_SLDS As String
'Dim v_UrlDocuSignOAuth2_SLDS As String

' Types de destinataires : (S) Signataire/Signer, (R) Lecteur obligatoire/Must read, (C) Copie conforme/Carbon copy, (E) Editeurs/Editor
Dim ga_TypeDestinataire_SLDS As Variant
Dim ga_TypeDestinataireKey_SLDS As Variant
' Types de signature : (S) Signature, (I) Initiales, (DS) Date de signature
Dim ga_TypeSignature_SLDS As Variant
Dim ga_TypeSignatureKey_SLDS As Variant

Dim ga_TypeLangueSI_SLDS As Variant
Dim ga_TypeLangueDS_SLDS As Variant


' Traitement des erreurs
' -----------------------------------
Const gc_TypeElement_SLDS = "SL"
Const gc_Element_SLDS = "SL_DocuSign"
' ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
Class cl_Document_SLDS
	Public IdDocument As string
	Public Nom As String
	Public Extension As String
	Public Base64 As String
	
	Sub New(p_IdDocument As String, p_CheminAcces As String, p_Base64 As String)
		
		Me.IdDocument = p_IdDocument
		Me.Nom = StrRightBack(p_CheminAcces, "\")
		If InStr(Me.Nom, ".") &gt; 0 Then
			Me.Extension = StrRightBack(Me.Nom, ".")
		End If
		Me.Base64 = p_Base64
		
	End Sub
	
	' ==================================================================================================================
	Public Function GenererJSON(pjsonw As JSONWriter, p_JSON As String) As Boolean
		On Error Goto GererErreur
		
		Dim v_JSON As String
		GenererJSON = False
		
		v_JSON = pjsonw.BeginObject	' {
		
		v_JSON = v_JSON &amp; pjsonw.Key("documentId")
		v_JSON = v_JSON &amp; pjsonw.AppendValue(me.IdDocument)
		v_JSON = v_JSON &amp; pjsonw.Key("name")
		v_JSON = v_JSON &amp; pjsonw.AppendValue(Me.Nom)
		v_JSON = v_JSON &amp; pjsonw.Key("fileExtension")
		v_JSON = v_JSON &amp; pjsonw.AppendValue(Me.Extension)
		v_JSON = v_JSON &amp; pjsonw.Key("documentBase64")
		v_JSON = v_JSON &amp; pjsonw.AppendValue("[Base64_" &amp; me.IdDocument &amp; "]")

		v_JSON = v_JSON &amp; pjsonw.EndObject		' }
		
		p_JSON = v_JSON
		GenererJSON = True
		Exit Function
		
GererErreur:
		Call SIGE_TraiterErreur(gc_TypeElement_SLDS, gc_Element_SLDS, Getthreadinfo(1), "", False)
		Exit Function		
	End Function
End Class
' ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
Class cl_ListeDocuments_SLDS
	Public NbDocuments As Integer
	Public ListeDocuments List As cl_Document_SLDS
	
	Sub New
		Me.NbDocuments = 0
	End Sub
	
	' ==================================================================================================================
	Public Function AjouterDocument(p_IdDocument As String, p_CheminAcces As String, p_Base64 As string) As Boolean
		On Error Goto GererErreur
		
		AjouterDocument = False
		
		Set Me.ListeDocuments(p_IdDocument) = New cl_Document_SLDS(p_IdDocument, p_CheminAcces, p_Base64)
		Me.NbDocuments = Me.NbDocuments + 1
		AjouterDocument = True
		Exit Function
		
GererErreur:
		Call SIGE_TraiterErreur(gc_TypeElement_SLDS, gc_Element_SLDS, Getthreadinfo(1), "", False)
		Exit Function		
	End Function
	
	' ==================================================================================================================
	Public Function xDocument(p_IdDocument As String) As cl_Document_SLDS
		On Error GoTo GererErreur
		
		Dim v_Document As cl_Document_SLDS
		
		If Me.NbDocuments &gt; 0 Then
			If IsElement(Me.ListeDocuments(p_IdDocument)) Then
				Set xDocument = Me.ListeDocuments(p_IdDocument)
			End If
		End If
		Exit Function
		
GererErreur:
		Call SIGE_TraiterErreur(gc_TypeElement_SLDS, gc_Element_SLDS, GetThreadInfo(1), p_IdDocument, False)
		Exit Function		
	End Function
	
	' ==================================================================================================================
	Public Function GenererJSON(pjsonw As JSONWriter, p_JSON As String) As Boolean
		On Error Goto GererErreur
		
		Dim v_JSON As String
		Dim v_JSON2 As String
		
		GenererJSON = False
		
		If Me.NbDocuments &gt; 0 Then
			v_JSON = pjsonw.Key("documents")
			v_JSON = v_JSON &amp; pjsonw.BeginArray			' [
			
			ForAll v_Element In Me.ListeDocuments
				If v_Element.GenererJSON(pjsonw, v_JSON2) Then
					v_JSON = v_JSON &amp; v_JSON2
				Else
					Exit Function
				End If	
			End ForAll
			
			v_JSON = v_JSON &amp; pjsonw.EndArray			' ]
		End If
		
		p_JSON = v_JSON
		GenererJSON = True
		Exit Function
		
GererErreur:
		Call SIGE_TraiterErreur(gc_TypeElement_SLDS, gc_Element_SLDS, Getthreadinfo(1), "", False)
		Exit Function		
	End Function
	
	' ==================================================================================================================
	Public Function GenererJSON_Base64(p_JSON As String) As Boolean
		On Error GoTo GererErreur
		
		Dim v_Signet As string
		Dim v_Debut As Long
		Dim v_Fin As Long
		
		GenererJSON_Base64 = False
		
		If Me.NbDocuments &gt; 0 Then
			ForAll v_Element In Me.ListeDocuments
				v_Signet = "[Base64_" &amp; v_Element.IdDocument &amp; "]"
				v_Debut = InStr(p_JSON, v_Signet) - 1
				v_Fin =  Len(p_JSON) - v_Debut - Len(v_Signet)
				p_JSON = Left(p_JSON, v_Debut) &amp; v_Element.Base64 &amp; Right(p_JSON, v_Fin)
			End ForAll
		End If
		
		GenererJSON_Base64 = True
		Exit Function
		
GererErreur:
		Call SIGE_TraiterErreur(gc_TypeElement_SLDS, gc_Element_SLDS, GetThreadInfo(1), "", False)
		Exit Function		
	End Function
End Class
' ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
Public Class cl_Envelope_SLDS
	Public Environnement As string
	Public Objet As String					' Obligatoire
	Public Message As String
	
	Public NbDestinataires As Integer
	ListeDestinataires As cl_ListeDestinataires_SLDS
	Public NbDocuments As Integer
	ListeDocuments As cl_ListeDocuments_SLDS
	
	Public Envoyee As Boolean
	Public Id As String
	Public URI As String
	Public Statut As String
	
	' ==================================================================================================================
	Sub New(p_Environnement As String, p_Objet As String, p_Message As String)
		On Error Goto GererErreur
		
		Me.Environnement = p_Environnement
		Me.Statut = ""
		
		Me.Objet = p_Objet
		Me.Message = p_Message
		
		Me.NbDestinataires = 0
		Me.NbDocuments = 0
		
		If Me.Environnement = "P" Or Me.Environnement = "L" Then		' Production ou Local
			REM v_UrlDocuSign_SLDS = "https://XXXX.docusign.net/restapi/v2.1"
			v_UrlDocuSign_SLDS = "https://www.docusign.net/restapi/v2.1"
'			v_UrlDocuSignOAuth2_SLDS = "https://account.docusign.com/oauth/auth"
		Else															' Développement/Tests
			v_UrlDocuSign_SLDS = "https://demo.docusign.net/restapi/v2.1"
'			v_UrlDocuSignOAuth2_SLDS = "https://account-d.docusign.com/oauth/auth"
		End If
		Exit Sub
		
GererErreur:
		Me.Statut = "E99"			' Erreur de programmation
		Call SIGE_TraiterErreur(gc_TypeElement_SLDS, gc_Element_SLDS, Getthreadinfo(1), "", False)
		Exit Sub	
	End Sub
	
	' ==================================================================================================================
	Public Function EnvelopeValide As Boolean
		' Action: 0 = New, 5 = Envoyer
		On Error Goto GererErreur
		
		Dim v_Statut As String
		
		EnvelopeValide = False
		
		If Me.Objet = "" Then
			v_Statut = "E02"		' Objet obligatoire
		End If
		
		If NbDestinataires = 0 Then
			v_Statut = "E51"
		End If
		
		If NbDocuments = 0 Then
			v_Statut = "E52"
		End If
		
		If v_Statut = "" Then
			Me.Statut = "OK"
			EnvelopeValide = True
		End If
		Exit Function
		
GererErreur:
		Statut = "E99"			' Erreur de programmation
		Call SIGE_TraiterErreur(gc_TypeElement_SLDS, gc_Element_SLDS, Getthreadinfo(1), "", False)
		Exit Function		
	End Function
	
	' ==================================================================================================================
	Public Function AjouterDestinataire(p_TypeDestinataire As String, p_Nom As String, p_Courriel As String, p_IdDestinataire As Integer, p_Ordre As Integer, p_Objet As String, p_Message As String, p_Langue As string) As Boolean
		' Types de destinataires : (S) Signataire/Signer, (R) Lecteur obligatoire/Must read, (C) Copie conforme/Carbon copy, (E) Editeurs/Editor
		On Error Goto GererErreur
		
		Dim v_IdDestinataire As String
		Dim v_Destinataire As cl_Destinataire_SLDS
		Dim v_Resultat As Integer
		
		AjouterDestinataire = False
		If Isnull(Arraygetindex(ga_TypeDestinataire_SLDS, p_TypeDestinataire, 0)) Or p_Nom = "" Or p_Courriel = "" Or p_IdDestinataire &lt;= 0 Or p_Ordre &lt;= 0 Then
			Me.Statut = "E10"
			Exit Function
		End If
		
		v_IdDestinataire = CStr(p_IdDestinataire)
		Set v_Destinataire = Me.xDestinataire(v_IdDestinataire)
		If Not (v_Destinataire Is Nothing) Then
			Me.Statut = "E11"
			Exit Function
		End If

		If Me.ListeDestinataires Is Nothing Then
			Set Me.ListeDestinataires = New cl_ListeDestinataires_SLDS
		End If
		
		v_Resultat = Me.ListeDestinataires.AjouterDestinataire("D", p_TypeDestinataire, p_Nom, p_Courriel, "", CStr(v_IdDestinataire), CStr(p_Ordre), p_Objet, p_Message, p_Langue)
		If v_Resultat = 1 Then
			Me.NbDestinataires = Me.NbDestinataires + 1
			AjouterDestinataire = True
		ElseIf v_Resultat = 0 Then
			Me.Statut = "A19"
		Else
			Me.Statut = "E19"
		End If
		
		Exit Function
		
GererErreur:
		Statut = "E99"			' Erreur de programmation
		Call SIGE_TraiterErreur(gc_TypeElement_SLDS, gc_Element_SLDS, Getthreadinfo(1), "", False)
		Exit Function		
	End Function
	
	' ==================================================================================================================
	Public Function AjouterGroupeDestinataires(p_TypeDestinataire As String, p_IdGroupe As Long, p_IdDestinataire As Long, p_Ordre As Integer, p_Objet As String, p_Message As String, p_Langue As String) As Boolean
		' Types de destinataires : (S) Signataire/Signer, (R) Lecteur obligatoire/Must read, (C) Copie conforme/Carbon copy, (E) Editeurs/Editor
		On Error GoTo GererErreur
		
		Dim v_IdDestinataire As String
		Dim v_Destinataire As cl_Destinataire_SLDS
		
		AjouterGroupeDestinataires = False
		If IsNull(ArrayGetIndex(ga_TypeDestinataire_SLDS, p_TypeDestinataire, 0)) Or p_IdGroupe &lt;= 0 Or p_IdDestinataire &lt;= 0 Or p_Ordre &lt;= 0 Then
			Me.Statut = "E20"
			Exit Function
		End If
		
		If Me.ListeDestinataires Is Nothing Then
			Set Me.ListeDestinataires = New cl_ListeDestinataires_SLDS
		End If
		
		v_IdDestinataire = CStr(p_IdDestinataire)
		Set v_Destinataire = Me.xDestinataire(v_IdDestinataire)
		If Not (v_Destinataire Is Nothing) Then
			Me.Statut = "E21"
			Exit Function
		End If
		
		If Me.ListeDestinataires.AjouterDestinataire("G", p_TypeDestinataire, "", "", CStr(p_IdGroupe), CStr(v_IdDestinataire), CStr(p_Ordre), p_Objet, p_Message, p_Langue) Then
			Me.NbDestinataires = Me.NbDestinataires + 1
			AjouterGroupeDestinataires = True
		Else
			Me.Statut = "E29"
		End If
		
		Exit Function
		
GererErreur:
		Statut = "E99"			' Erreur de programmation
		Call SIGE_TraiterErreur(gc_TypeElement_SLDS, gc_Element_SLDS, GetThreadInfo(1), "", False)
		Exit Function		
	End Function
	
	' ==================================================================================================================
	Public Function AjouterSignature(p_IdDestinataire As Integer, p_TypeSignature As String, p_IdDocument As Integer, p_Signet As String, p_AjustementX As Integer, p_AjustementY As Integer) As Boolean
		On Error Goto GererErreur
		
		Dim v_IdDestinataire As String
		Dim v_Destinataire As cl_Destinataire_SLDS
		Dim v_IdDocument As String
		Dim v_Document As cl_Document_SLDS
		
		AjouterSignature = False
		If Isnull(Arraygetindex(ga_TypeSignature_SLDS, p_TypeSignature, 0)) Or p_Signet = "" Then
			Me.Statut = "E40"
			Exit Function
		End If
		
		v_IdDestinataire = CStr(p_IdDestinataire)
		Set v_Destinataire = Me.xDestinataire(v_IdDestinataire)
		If v_Destinataire Is Nothing Then
			Me.Statut = "E41"
			Exit Function
		End If
		
		v_IdDocument = CStr(p_IdDocument)
		Set v_Document = Me.xDocument(v_IdDocument)
		If v_Document Is Nothing Then
			Me.Statut = "E42"
			Exit Function
		End If
		
		If v_Destinataire.AjouterSignature(p_TypeSignature, v_IdDocument, p_Signet, p_AjustementX, p_AjustementY) Then
			AjouterSignature = True
		Else
			Me.Statut = "E49"
		End If
		
		Exit Function
		
GererErreur:
		Statut = "E99"			' Erreur de programmation
		Call SIGE_TraiterErreur(gc_TypeElement_SLDS, gc_Element_SLDS, Getthreadinfo(1), v_IdDestinataire, False)
		Exit Function
	End Function
	
	' ==================================================================================================================
	Public Function AjouterDocument(p_IdDocument As Integer, p_CheminAcces As String) As Boolean
		On Error Goto GererErreur
		
		Dim v_IdDocument As String
		Dim v_Document As cl_Document_SLDS
		Dim v_CheminFichierBase64 As String
		Dim v_Base64 As String
		
		AjouterDocument = False
		If p_IdDocument &lt;= 0 Or p_CheminAcces = "" Then
			Me.Statut = "E60"
			Exit Function
		End If
		
		v_IdDocument = CStr(p_IdDocument)
		Set v_Document = Me.xDocument(v_IdDocument)
		If Not (v_Document Is Nothing) Then
			Me.Statut = "E61"
			Exit Function
		End If
		
		If Dir$(p_CheminAcces, 0) = "" Then
			Me.Statut = "E462"
			Exit Function
		End If
		
		v_CheminFichierBase64 = p_CheminAcces &amp; ".b64"
		If SLFWIN_EncoderFichierBase64(p_CheminAcces, v_CheminFichierBase64, False) Then
			v_Base64 = SLFWIN_LireFichierString(v_CheminFichierBase64)
			Kill v_CheminFichierBase64
			If v_Base64 &lt;&gt; "" Then
				If Me.ListeDocuments Is Nothing Then
					Set Me.ListeDocuments = New cl_ListeDocuments_SLDS
				End If
				
				If Me.ListeDocuments.AjouterDocument(v_IdDocument, p_CheminAcces, v_Base64) Then
					Me.NbDocuments = Me.NbDocuments + 1
					AjouterDocument = True
				Else
					Me.Statut = "E69"
				End If
			else
				Me.Statut = "E64"
			End If
		else
			Me.Statut = "E63"
		End If
		Exit Function
		
GererErreur:
		Statut = "E69"			' Erreur de programmation
		Call SIGE_TraiterErreur(gc_TypeElement_SLDS, gc_Element_SLDS, Getthreadinfo(1), p_CheminAcces, False)
		Exit Function
	End Function
	
	' ==================================================================================================================
	Public Function AjouterMessage(p_Message As String, p_NbLignesBlanches As Integer) As Boolean
		On Error Goto GererErreur
		
		Dim i As Integer
		
		AjouterMessage = False
		If p_Message = "" Then
			Me.Statut = "E18"
			Exit Function
		End If
		
		For i = 1 To p_NbLignesBlanches + 1
			Me.Message = Me.Message &amp; Chr(13)
		Next
		
		Me.Message = Me.Message &amp; p_Message
		AjouterMessage = True
		Exit Function
		
GererErreur:
		Statut = "E99"			' Erreur de programmation
		Call SIGE_TraiterErreur(gc_TypeElement_SLDS, gc_Element_SLDS, Getthreadinfo(1), "", False)
		Exit Function
	End Function
	
	' ==================================================================================================================
	Public Function Envoyer(p_email As String, p_Password As String, p_IntegratorKey As String, p_Brouillon As Boolean) As Boolean
		On Error Goto GererErreur
		
		Dim l_LoginAccount List As Variant
		Dim v_JSON As String
		Dim v_URL As String
		Dim v_Reponse As Integer
		Dim v_ReponseJSON As String
		Dim njsonn As NotesJSONNavigator
		
		Envoyer = False
		
		If Me.Envoyee Then
			Me.Statut = "E60"				' Erreur envelope déjà envoyée
			Exit Function
		End If
		If Not me.EnvelopeValide Then
			Exit Function
		End If
		
		If SLDS_LoginAccount(p_email, p_Password, p_IntegratorKey, l_LoginAccount) Then
			If Me.GenererJSON(v_JSON, p_Brouillon) Then
				v_URL = l_LoginAccount("baseUrl") &amp; |/envelopes|
				
				If SLDS_EnvoyerTransaction(l_LoginAccount, "POST", v_URL, v_JSON, v_Reponse, v_ReponseJSON) Then
					v_ReponseJSON = Replace(Replace(v_ReponseJSON, Chr(13), ""), Chr(10), "")

					Set njsonn = gns_SLDS.Createjsonnavigator(v_ReponseJSON)
					Me.Id = SLJS_ExtraireValeur_Pointeur(njsonn, "/envelopeId")
					Me.URI = SLJS_ExtraireValeur_Pointeur(njsonn, "/uri")
					Me.Statut = SLJS_ExtraireValeur_Pointeur(njsonn, "/status")

					Me.Envoyee = True
					Envoyer = True
				Else
					Me.Statut = "E63"		' Erreur envoi de la transaction
				End If
			Else
				Me.Statut = "E62"			' Erreur génération du JSON
			End If
		Else
			Me.Statut = "E61"				' Erreur LoginAccount
		End If
		Exit Function
		
GererErreur:
		Me.Statut = "E99"			' Erreur de programmation
		Call SIGE_TraiterErreur(gc_TypeElement_SLDS, gc_Element_SLDS, Getthreadinfo(1), "", False)
		Exit Function
	End Function
	
	' ==================================================================================================================
	Public Function GenererJSON(p_JSON As String, p_Brouillon As Boolean) As Boolean
		On Error Goto GererErreur
		
		Dim jsonw As JSONWriter
		Dim v_JSON As string
		Dim v_JSON2 As String
		Dim v_Parametres List As Variant
		
		GenererJSON = False
		
		Set jsonw = New JSONWriter
		v_JSON = jsonw.BeginObject		' {
		v_JSON = v_JSON &amp; jsonw.Key("emailSubject")
		v_JSON = v_JSON &amp; jsonw.AppendValue(Me.Objet)
		If Me.Message &lt;&gt; "" Then
			v_JSON = v_JSON &amp; jsonw.Key("emailBlurb")
			v_JSON = v_JSON &amp; jsonw.AppendValue(Me.Message)
		End If
		
		If NbDestinataires &gt; 0 Then
			v_Parametres("Objet") = me.Objet	
			v_Parametres("Message") = me.Message
			If Me.ListeDestinataires.GenererJSON(jsonw, v_JSON2, v_Parametres) Then
				v_JSON = v_JSON &amp; v_JSON2
			Else
				Exit Function
			End If
		End If
		If NbDocuments &gt; 0 Then
			If Me.ListeDocuments.GenererJSON(jsonw, v_JSON2) Then
				v_JSON = v_JSON &amp; v_JSON2
			Else
				Exit Function
			End If
		End If
		
		v_JSON = v_JSON &amp; jsonw.Key("status")
		If p_Brouillon Then
			v_JSON = v_JSON &amp; jsonw.AppendValue("created")
		Else
			v_JSON = v_JSON &amp; jsonw.AppendValue("sent")
		End If
		v_JSON = v_JSON &amp; jsonw.EndObject		' }
		
		' --------------------------------------------------------
		Call SIGE_OuvrirLog(gc_TypeElement_SLDS, gc_Element_SLDS)
		Call SIGE_AjouterLog(v_JSON, 0, 0, False)
		Call SIGE_EnregistrerLog
		' --------------------------------------------------------
		
		If NbDocuments &gt; 0 Then
			If Me.ListeDocuments.GenererJSON_Base64(v_JSON) = False Then
				Exit Function
			End If
		End If
		
		p_JSON = v_JSON
		GenererJSON = True
		Exit Function
		
GererErreur:
		Call SIGE_TraiterErreur(gc_TypeElement_SLDS, gc_Element_SLDS, Getthreadinfo(1), "", False)
		Exit Function
	End Function
	' ==================================================================================================================
	Public Function xDestinataire(p_IdDestinataire As String) As cl_Destinataire_SLDS
		On Error GoTo GererErreur
		
		If me.NbDestinataires &gt; 0 then
			Set xDestinataire = Me.ListeDestinataires.xDestinataire(p_IdDestinataire)
		End If
		Exit Function
		
GererErreur:
		Statut = "E99"			' Erreur de programmation
		Call SIGE_TraiterErreur(gc_TypeElement_SLDS, gc_Element_SLDS, GetThreadInfo(1), p_IdDestinataire, False)
		Exit Function
	End Function
	' ==================================================================================================================
	Public Function xDocument(p_IdDocument As String) As cl_Document_SLDS
		On Error GoTo GererErreur
		
		If me.NbDocuments &gt; 0 then
			Set xDocument = Me.ListeDocuments.xDocument(p_IdDocument)
		End If
		
		Exit Function
		
GererErreur:
		Statut = "E99"			' Erreur de programmation
		Call SIGE_TraiterErreur(gc_TypeElement_SLDS, gc_Element_SLDS, GetThreadInfo(1), p_IdDocument, False)
		Exit Function
	End Function
		
End Class
' ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
Class cl_Destinataire_SLDS
	Public ClasseDestinataire As String
	Public TypeDestinataire As String
	Public Nom As String
	Public Courriel As String
	Public IdGroupe As String
	Public IdDestinataire As String
	Public Ordre As String
	Public Objet As String
	Public Message As String
	Public Langue As String
	
	Public NbSignatures As Integer
	ListeSignatures As cl_ListeSignatures_SLDS
	
	Sub New(p_ClasseDestinataire As String, p_TypeDestinataire As String, p_Nom As String, p_Courriel As String, p_IdGroupe As String, p_IdDestinataire As String, p_Ordre As String, p_Objet As String, p_Message As String, p_Langue As String)
		
		Dim v As Variant
		Dim v_Langue As String
		
		Me.ClasseDestinataire = p_ClasseDestinataire
		Me.TypeDestinataire = p_TypeDestinataire
		Me.Nom = p_Nom
		Me.Courriel = p_Courriel
		Me.IdGroupe = p_IdGroupe
		Me.IdDestinataire = p_IdDestinataire
		Me.Ordre = p_Ordre
		Me.Objet = p_Objet
		Me.Message = p_Message
		
		If p_Langue &lt;&gt; "" Then
			v = ArrayGetIndex(ga_TypeLangueDS_SLDS, p_Langue, 0)
			If Not IsNull(v) Then
				v_Langue = p_Langue
			Else
				v = ArrayGetIndex(ga_TypeLangueSI_SLDS, p_Langue, 0)
				If Not IsNull(v) Then
					v_Langue = ga_TypeLangueDS_SLDS(v)
				End If
			End If
		End If
		Me.Langue = v_Langue
		
	End Sub
	
	' ==================================================================================================================
	Function AjouterSignature(p_TypeSignature As String, p_IdDocument As String, p_Signet As String, p_AjustementX As Integer, p_AjustementY As Integer) As Boolean
		On Error Goto GererErreur
		
		Dim v_Destinataire As cl_Destinataire_SLDS
		
		AjouterSignature = False
		
		If Me.ListeSignatures Is Nothing Then
			Set Me.ListeSignatures = New cl_ListeSignatures_SLDS
		End If
		
		If Me.ListeSignatures.AjouterSignature(p_TypeSignature, p_IdDocument, p_Signet, p_AjustementX, p_AjustementY) Then
			Me.NbSignatures = Me.NbSignatures + 1
			AjouterSignature = True
		End If
		
		Exit Function
		
GererErreur:
		Call SIGE_TraiterErreur(gc_TypeElement_SLDS, gc_Element_SLDS, Getthreadinfo(1), "", False)
		Exit Function
	End Function
	
	' ==================================================================================================================
	Function GenererJSON(pjsonw As JSONWriter, p_JSON As String, p_Parametres List As Variant) As Boolean
		On Error Goto GererErreur
		
		Dim v_JSON As String
		Dim v_JSON2 As String
		
		GenererJSON = False
		
		v_JSON = pjsonw.BeginObject	' {
		
		v_JSON = v_JSON &amp; pjsonw.Key("recipientId")
		v_JSON = v_JSON &amp; pjsonw.AppendValue(Me.IdDestinataire)
		If me.ClasseDestinataire = "G" Then
'			v_JSON = v_JSON &amp; pjsonw.Key("signingGroupName")
'			v_JSON = v_JSON &amp; pjsonw.AppendValue(Me.Nom)
			v_JSON = v_JSON &amp; pjsonw.Key("signingGroupId")
			v_JSON = v_JSON &amp; pjsonw.AppendValue(Me.IdGroupe)
		Else
			v_JSON = v_JSON &amp; pjsonw.Key("name")
			v_JSON = v_JSON &amp; pjsonw.AppendValue(Me.Nom)
			v_JSON = v_JSON &amp; pjsonw.Key("email")
			v_JSON = v_JSON &amp; pjsonw.AppendValue(Me.Courriel)
		End If
		v_JSON = v_JSON &amp; pjsonw.Key("routingOrder")
		v_JSON = v_JSON &amp; pjsonw.AppendValue(Me.Ordre)
		
		If me.Langue &lt;&gt; "" Or me.Objet &lt;&gt; "" Or me.Message &lt;&gt; "" Then
			v_JSON = v_JSON &amp; pjsonw.Key("emailNotification")
			v_JSON = v_JSON &amp; pjsonw.BeginObject	' {
			
			v_JSON = v_JSON &amp; pjsonw.Key("emailSubject")
			If me.Objet &lt;&gt; "" Then
				v_JSON = v_JSON &amp; pjsonw.AppendValue(Me.Objet)
			Else
				v_JSON = v_JSON &amp; pjsonw.AppendValue(p_Parametres("Objet"))
			End If
			If me.Message &lt;&gt; "" Then
				v_JSON = v_JSON &amp; pjsonw.Key("emailBody")
				v_JSON = v_JSON &amp; pjsonw.AppendValue(Me.Message)
			ElseIf p_Parametres("Message") &lt;&gt; "" then
				v_JSON = v_JSON &amp; pjsonw.Key("emailBody")
				v_JSON = v_JSON &amp; pjsonw.AppendValue(p_Parametres("Message"))
			End if
			If me.Langue &lt;&gt; "" then
				v_JSON = v_JSON &amp; pjsonw.Key("supportedLanguage")
				v_JSON = v_JSON &amp; pjsonw.AppendValue(me.Langue)
			End If
			
			v_JSON = v_JSON &amp; pjsonw.EndObject	' }
		End if
		
		If Me.NbSignatures &gt; 0 Then
			If Me.ListeSignatures.GenererJSON(pjsonw, v_JSON2) Then
				v_JSON = v_JSON &amp; v_JSON2
			Else
				Exit Function
			End If
		End If
		
		v_JSON = v_JSON &amp; pjsonw.EndObject	' }
		
		p_JSON = v_JSON
		GenererJSON = True
		Exit Function
		
GererErreur:
		Call SIGE_TraiterErreur(gc_TypeElement_SLDS, gc_Element_SLDS, Getthreadinfo(1), "", False)
		Exit Function		
	End Function
End Class
' ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
Class cl_ListeDestinataires_SLDS
	' Types de destinataires : (S) Signataire/Signer, (C) Copie conforme/CarbonCopy, (E) Editeurs/Editor, (T) Témoin/Witness
	
	Public NbDestinataires As Integer
	Public ListeDestinatairesType List As cl_ListeDestinatairesType_SLDS
	Public IdsDestinataires List As String
	
	Sub New
		Me.NbDestinataires = 0
	End Sub
	
	' ==================================================================================================================
	Public Function AjouterDestinataire(p_ClasseDestinataire As String, p_TypeDestinataire As String, p_Nom As String, p_Courriel As String, p_IdGroupe As String, p_IdDestinataire As String, p_Ordre As String, p_Objet As String, p_Message As String, p_Langue As string) As Integer
		On Error Goto GererErreur
		
		Dim v_Destinataire As cl_Destinataire_SLDS
		
		AjouterDestinataire = -1
		
		ForAll l_TypeDestinataire In Me.ListeDestinatairesType
			ForAll l_Destinataire In l_TypeDestinataire.ListeDestinataires			
				If l_Destinataire.Courriel = p_Courriel And l_Destinataire.Ordre = p_Ordre Then
					AjouterDestinataire = 0			
					Exit Function
				End If				
			End Forall
		End ForAll
		
		If Not Iselement(Me.ListeDestinatairesType(p_TypeDestinataire)) Then
			Set Me.ListeDestinatairesType(p_TypeDestinataire) = New cl_ListeDestinatairesType_SLDS(p_TypeDestinataire)
		End If
		
		If Me.ListeDestinatairesType(p_TypeDestinataire).AjouterDestinataire(p_ClasseDestinataire, p_TypeDestinataire, p_Nom, p_Courriel, p_IdGroupe, p_IdDestinataire, p_Ordre, p_Objet, p_Message, p_Langue) Then
			Me.NbDestinataires = Me.NbDestinataires + 1
			AjouterDestinataire = 1
		End If
		
		Exit Function
		
GererErreur:
		Call SIGE_TraiterErreur(gc_TypeElement_SLDS, gc_Element_SLDS, Getthreadinfo(1), "", False)
		Exit Function		
	End Function
	
	' ==================================================================================================================
	Public Function xDestinataire(p_IdDestinataire As String) As cl_Destinataire_SLDS
		On Error Goto GererErreur
		
		Dim v_TypeDestinataire As String
		Dim v_Destinataire As cl_Destinataire_SLDS
		
		If Me.NbDestinataires &gt; 0 Then
			Forall v_Element In Me.ListeDestinatairesType
				v_TypeDestinataire = Listtag(v_Element)
				Set v_Destinataire = Me.ListeDestinatairesType(v_TypeDestinataire).xDestinataire(p_IdDestinataire)
				If Not (v_Destinataire Is Nothing) Then
					Set xDestinataire = v_Destinataire
					Exit Forall
				End If
			End Forall
		End If
		Exit Function
		
GererErreur:
		Call SIGE_TraiterErreur(gc_TypeElement_SLDS, gc_Element_SLDS, Getthreadinfo(1), p_IdDestinataire, False)
		Exit Function		
	End Function
	
	' ==================================================================================================================
	Public Function GenererJSON(pjsonw As JSONWriter, p_JSON As String, p_Parametres List As Variant) As Boolean
		On Error Goto GererErreur
		
		Dim v_JSON As String
		Dim v_JSON2 As String
		
		GenererJSON = False
		
		If Me.NbDestinataires &gt; 0 Then
			v_JSON = pjsonw.Key("recipients")
			v_JSON = v_JSON &amp; pjsonw.BeginObject	' {
			
			Forall v_Element In Me.ListeDestinatairesType
				If v_Element.GenererJSON(pjsonw, v_JSON2, p_Parametres) Then
					v_JSON = v_JSON &amp; v_JSON2
				Else
					Exit Function
				End If
			End Forall
			
			v_JSON = v_JSON &amp; pjsonw.EndObject		' }
			p_JSON = v_JSON
		End If
		
		GenererJSON = True
		Exit Function
		
GererErreur:
		Call SIGE_TraiterErreur(gc_TypeElement_SLDS, gc_Element_SLDS, Getthreadinfo(1), "", False)
		Exit Function		
	End Function
End Class
' ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
Class cl_ListeDestinatairesType_SLDS
	Public TypeDestinataire As String
	Public NbDestinataires As Integer
	Public ListeDestinataires List As cl_Destinataire_SLDS
	
	Sub New(p_TypeDestinataire As String)
		me.TypeDestinataire = p_TypeDestinataire
		me.NbDestinataires = 0
	End Sub
	
	' ==================================================================================================================
	Public Function AjouterDestinataire(p_ClasseDestinataire As string, p_TypeDestinataire As String, p_Nom As String, p_Courriel As String, p_IdGroupe As String, p_IdDestinataire As String, p_Ordre As String, p_Objet As String, p_Message As String, p_Langue As string) As Boolean
		On Error Goto GererErreur
		
		AjouterDestinataire = False
		
		Set Me.ListeDestinataires(p_IdDestinataire) = New cl_Destinataire_SLDS(p_ClasseDestinataire, p_TypeDestinataire, p_Nom, p_Courriel, p_IdGroupe, p_IdDestinataire, p_Ordre, p_Objet, p_Message, p_Langue)
		Me.NbDestinataires = Me.NbDestinataires + 1
		AjouterDestinataire = True
		Exit Function
		
GererErreur:
		Call SIGE_TraiterErreur(gc_TypeElement_SLDS, gc_Element_SLDS, Getthreadinfo(1), "", False)
		Exit Function		
	End Function
	
	' ==================================================================================================================
	Public Function xDestinataire(p_IdDestinataire As String) As cl_Destinataire_SLDS
		On Error Goto GererErreur
		
		Dim v_Destinataire As cl_Destinataire_SLDS
		
		If Me.NbDestinataires &gt; 0 Then
			If IsElement(Me.ListeDestinataires(p_IdDestinataire)) Then
				Set xDestinataire = Me.ListeDestinataires(p_IdDestinataire)
			End If
		End If
		Exit Function
		
GererErreur:
		Call SIGE_TraiterErreur(gc_TypeElement_SLDS, gc_Element_SLDS, Getthreadinfo(1), p_IdDestinataire, False)
		Exit Function		
	End Function
	
	' ==================================================================================================================
	Function GenererJSON(pjsonw As JSONWriter, p_JSON As String, p_Parametres List As Variant) As Boolean
		On Error Goto GererErreur
		
		Dim v As Variant
		Dim v_JSON As String
		Dim v_JSON2 As String
		
		GenererJSON = False
		
		If Me.NbDestinataires &gt; 0 Then
			v = Arraygetindex(ga_TypeDestinataire_SLDS, me.TypeDestinataire, 0)
			v_JSON = pjsonw.Key(ga_TypeDestinataireKey_SLDS(v))
			v_JSON = v_JSON &amp; pjsonw.BeginArray		' [
			
			ForAll v_Element In Me.ListeDestinataires
				If v_Element.GenererJSON(pjsonw, v_JSON2, p_Parametres) Then
					v_JSON = v_JSON &amp; v_JSON2
				Else
					Exit Function
				End If			
			End ForAll
			
			v_JSON = v_JSON &amp; pjsonw.EndArray		' ]
			p_JSON = v_JSON
		End If
		
		GenererJSON = True
		Exit Function
		
GererErreur:
		Call SIGE_TraiterErreur(gc_TypeElement_SLDS, gc_Element_SLDS, Getthreadinfo(1), "", False)
		Exit Function		
	End Function
End Class
' ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
Class cl_Signature_SLDS
	Public TypeSignature As String
	Public IdDocument As string
	Public Signet As String
	Public AjustementX As Integer
	Public AjustementY As Integer
	Public Unite As String
	Public Obligatoire As Boolean
	
	Sub New(p_TypeSignature As String, p_IdDocument As String, p_Signet As String, p_AjustementX As Integer, p_AjustementY As Integer)
		
		Me.TypeSignature = p_TypeSignature
		Me.IdDocument = p_IdDocument
		Me.Signet = p_Signet
		Me.AjustementX = p_AjustementX
		Me.AjustementY = p_AjustementY
		Me.Obligatoire = True
		Me.Unite = "mms"
		
	End Sub
	
	' ==================================================================================================================
	Public Function GenererJSON(pjsonw As JSONWriter, p_JSON As String) As Boolean
		On Error Goto GererErreur
		
		Dim v_JSON As String
		
		GenererJSON = False
		
		v_JSON = pjsonw.BeginObject	' {
		
		v_JSON = v_JSON &amp; pjsonw.Key("documentId")
		v_JSON = v_JSON &amp; pjsonw.AppendValue(Me.IdDocument)
		v_JSON = v_JSON &amp; pjsonw.Key("anchorString")
		v_JSON = v_JSON &amp; pjsonw.AppendValue(Me.Signet)
		v_JSON = v_JSON &amp; pjsonw.Key("anchorXOffset")
		v_JSON = v_JSON &amp; pjsonw.AppendValue(Cstr(Me.AjustementX))
		v_JSON = v_JSON &amp; pjsonw.Key("anchorYOffset")
		v_JSON = v_JSON &amp; pjsonw.AppendValue(Cstr(Me.AjustementY))
		v_JSON = v_JSON &amp; pjsonw.Key("anchorIgnoreIfNotPresent")
		If Me.Obligatoire Then
			v_JSON = v_JSON &amp; pjsonw.AppendValue("false")
		Else
			v_JSON = v_JSON &amp; pjsonw.AppendValue("true")
		End If
		v_JSON = v_JSON &amp; pjsonw.Key("anchorUnits")
		v_JSON = v_JSON &amp; pjsonw.AppendValue(Me.Unite)
		
		v_JSON = v_JSON &amp; pjsonw.EndObject		' }
		
		p_JSON = v_JSON
		GenererJSON = True
		Exit Function
		
GererErreur:
		Call SIGE_TraiterErreur(gc_TypeElement_SLDS, gc_Element_SLDS, Getthreadinfo(1), "", False)
		Exit Function		
	End Function
End Class
' ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
Class cl_ListeSignatures_SLDS
	' Types de Signatures : (S) Signataire/Signer, (C) Copie conforme/CarbonCopy, (E) Editeurs/Editor, (T) Témoin/Witness
	
	Public NbSignatures As Integer
	Public ListeSignaturesType List As cl_ListeSignaturesType_SLDS
	Public IdsSignatures List As String
	
	Sub New
		Me.NbSignatures = 0
	End Sub
	
	' ==================================================================================================================
	Public Function AjouterSignature(p_TypeSignature As String, p_IdDocument As String, p_Signet As String, p_AjustementX As Integer, p_AjustementY As Integer) As Boolean
		On Error Goto GererErreur
		
		Dim v_Signature As cl_Signature_SLDS
		
		AjouterSignature = False
		
		If Not Iselement(Me.ListeSignaturesType(p_TypeSignature)) Then
			Set Me.ListeSignaturesType(p_TypeSignature) = New cl_ListeSignaturesType_SLDS
		End If
		
		If Me.ListeSignaturesType(p_TypeSignature).AjouterSignature(p_TypeSignature, p_IdDocument, p_Signet, p_AjustementX, p_AjustementY) Then
			Me.NbSignatures = Me.NbSignatures + 1
			AjouterSignature = True
		End If
		
		Exit Function
		
GererErreur:
		Call SIGE_TraiterErreur(gc_TypeElement_SLDS, gc_Element_SLDS, Getthreadinfo(1), "", False)
		Exit Function		
	End Function
	
	
	' ==================================================================================================================
	Public Function GenererJSON(pjsonw As JSONWriter, p_JSON As String) As Boolean
		On Error Goto GererErreur
		
		Dim v_JSON As String
		Dim v_TypeSignature As String
		Dim v_JSON2 As String
		
		GenererJSON = False
		
		If Me.NbSignatures &gt; 0 Then
			v_JSON = pjsonw.Key("tabs")
			v_JSON = v_JSON &amp; pjsonw.BeginObject	' {
			
			Forall v_Element In Me.ListeSignaturesType
				v_TypeSignature = Listtag(v_Element)
				If Me.ListeSignaturesType(v_TypeSignature).GenererJSON(pjsonw, v_JSON2, v_TypeSignature) Then
					v_JSON = v_JSON &amp; v_JSON2
				Else
					Exit Function
				End If
			End Forall
			
			v_JSON = v_JSON &amp; pjsonw.EndObject		' }
			p_JSON = v_JSON
		End If
		
		GenererJSON = True
		Exit Function
		
GererErreur:
		Call SIGE_TraiterErreur(gc_TypeElement_SLDS, gc_Element_SLDS, Getthreadinfo(1), "", False)
		Exit Function		
	End Function
End Class
' ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
Class cl_ListeSignaturesType_SLDS
	Public NbSignatures As Integer
	Public ListeSignatures List As cl_Signature_SLDS
	
	Sub New
		NbSignatures = 0
	End Sub
	
	' ==================================================================================================================
	Public Function AjouterSignature(p_TypeSignature As String, p_IdDocument As String, p_Signet As String, p_AjustementX As Integer, p_AjustementY As Integer) As Boolean
		On Error Goto GererErreur
		
		Dim v_NoSignature As Integer
		Dim v_NoSignatureS As String
		
		AjouterSignature = False
		
		v_NoSignature = Me.NbSignatures + 1
		v_NoSignatureS = Cstr(v_NoSignature)
		Set Me.ListeSignatures(v_NoSignatureS) = New cl_Signature_SLDS(p_TypeSignature, p_IdDocument, p_Signet, p_AjustementX, p_AjustementY)
		
		Me.NbSignatures = v_NoSignature
		AjouterSignature = True
		Exit Function
		
GererErreur:
		Call SIGE_TraiterErreur(gc_TypeElement_SLDS, gc_Element_SLDS, Getthreadinfo(1), "", False)
		Exit Function		
	End Function
	
	' ==================================================================================================================
	Function GenererJSON(pjsonw As JSONWriter, p_JSON As String, p_TypeSignature As String) As Boolean
		On Error Goto GererErreur
		
		Dim v As Variant
		Dim v_JSON As String
		Dim i As Integer
		Dim v_JSON2 As String
		
		GenererJSON = False
		
		If Me.NbSignatures &gt; 0 Then
			v = Arraygetindex(ga_TypeSignature_SLDS, p_TypeSignature, 0)
			v_JSON = pjsonw.Key(ga_TypeSignatureKey_SLDS(v))
			v_JSON = v_JSON &amp; pjsonw.BeginArray		' [
			
			For i = 1 To Me.NbSignatures
				If Me.ListeSignatures(CStr(i)).GenererJSON(pjsonw, v_JSON2) Then
					v_JSON = v_JSON &amp; v_JSON2
				Else
					Exit Function
				End If
			Next
			
			v_JSON = v_JSON &amp; pjsonw.EndArray		' ]
			p_JSON = v_JSON
		End If
		
		GenererJSON = True
		Exit Function
		
GererErreur:
		Call SIGE_TraiterErreur(gc_TypeElement_SLDS, gc_Element_SLDS, Getthreadinfo(1), "", False)
		Exit Function		
	End Function
End Class
</lotusscript></code><code event="initialize"><lotusscript>Sub Initialize
	ga_TypeDestinataire_SLDS = Evaluate(|"C":"R":"E":"S"|)
	ga_TypeDestinataireKey_SLDS = Evaluate(|"carbonCopies":"certifiedDeliveries":"editors":"signers"|)
	
	ga_TypeSignature_SLDS = Evaluate(|"I":"S":"DS"|)
	ga_TypeSignatureKey_SLDS = Evaluate(|"initialHereTabs":"signHereTabs":"dateSignedTabs"|)

	ga_TypeLangueSI_SLDS = Evaluate(|"FR":"EN"|)
	ga_TypeLangueDS_SLDS = Evaluate(|"fr_CA":"en"|)
End Sub

</lotusscript></code><code event="SLDS_EnvoyerTransaction"><lotusscript>Function SLDS_EnvoyerTransaction(pl_LoginAccount List As Variant, p_TypeTransaction As String, p_URL As String, p_Data As String, p_Reponse As Integer, p_ReponseJSON As String) As Boolean
	On Error Goto GererErreur
	
	Dim objHttp As Variant
	Dim v_Reponse As String
	
	SLDS_EnvoyerTransaction = False
	
	' --- instantiate an MSXML XMLHTTP object
	Set objHttp = CreateObject("Microsoft.XMLHTTP")
	'Set objHttp = CreateObject("MSXML2.ServerXMLHTTP")
	
	' --- open a new POST request and set the Content-type header 
	objHttp.open p_TypeTransaction, p_url, False
	objHttp.setRequestHeader "X-DocuSign-Authentication", pl_LoginAccount("authenticationJSON")
	objHttp.setRequestHeader "Content-type", "application/json"
	objHttp.setRequestHeader "Accept", "application/json"
	If p_TypeTransaction = "POST" Then
		objHttp.send(p_Data)
	Else
		objHttp.send
	End If
	
	v_Reponse = objHTTP.Status
	p_ReponseJSON = objHttp.responseText
	Set objHttp = Nothing
	
	p_Reponse = Cint(v_Reponse)
	If p_Reponse &lt; 300 Then
		SLDS_EnvoyerTransaction = True
	Else
		Call SIGE_TraiterErreurManuelle(gc_TypeElement_SLDS, gc_Element_SLDS, Getthreadinfo(1), 0, v_Reponse, p_ReponseJSON, False)
	End If
	Exit Function
	
GererErreur:
	Set objHttp = Nothing
	Call SIGE_TraiterErreur(gc_TypeElement_SLDS, gc_Element_SLDS, Getthreadinfo(1), p_TypeTransaction &amp; " " &amp; p_URL, False)
	Exit Function
End Function

</lotusscript></code><code event="SLDS_LoginAccount"><lotusscript>Function SLDS_LoginAccount(p_email As String, p_Password As String, p_IntegratorKey As String, pl_LoginAccount List As Variant) As Boolean
	On Error Goto GererErreur
	
	%REM	
	|{ "loginAccounts": [
    { "name": "Serti Informatique",
      "accountId": "8985885",
      "baseUrl": "https://demo.docusign.net/restapi/v2/accounts/8985885",
      "isDefault": "true",
      "userName": "Patrick Beauchamp",
      "userId": "6928c6a0-abfa-4843-abdb-ad5a657dbf3c",
      "email": "pbeauchamp@serti.com",
      "siteDescription": ""
    }]}|
	%END REM
	
	Dim v_URL As String
	Dim v_UserName As String
	Dim v_Password As String
	Dim v_Reponse As Integer
	Dim v_ReponseJSON As String
	Dim njsonn As NotesJSONNavigator
	
	SLDS_LoginAccount = 0
	Erase pl_LoginAccount
	Call SLDS_Initialisations
	v_URL = v_UrlDocuSign_SLDS &amp; |/login_information|
	
	pl_loginAccount("email") = p_email
	pl_loginAccount("password") = p_Password
	pl_loginAccount("integratorKey") = p_IntegratorKey
	pl_LoginAccount("authenticationJSON") = |{"Username":"| &amp; pl_LoginAccount("email") &amp; |","Password":"| &amp; pl_LoginAccount("password") &amp; |","IntegratorKey":"| &amp; pl_LoginAccount("integratorKey") &amp; |"}|
	
	If SLDS_EnvoyerTransaction(pl_LoginAccount, "GET", v_URL, "", v_Reponse, v_ReponseJSON) Then
		v_ReponseJSON = Replace(Replace(v_ReponseJSON, Chr(13), ""), Chr(10), "")
		Set njsonn = gns_SLDS.Createjsonnavigator(v_ReponseJSON)

		pl_LoginAccount("name") = SLJS_ExtraireValeur_Pointeur(njsonn, "/loginAccounts/0/name")
		pl_LoginAccount("accountId") = SLJS_ExtraireValeur_Pointeur(njsonn, "/loginAccounts/0/accountId")
		pl_LoginAccount("baseUrl") = SLJS_ExtraireValeur_Pointeur(njsonn, "/loginAccounts/0/baseUrl")
		pl_LoginAccount("isDefault") = SLJS_ExtraireValeur_Pointeur(njsonn, "/loginAccounts/0/isDefault")
		pl_LoginAccount("userName") = SLJS_ExtraireValeur_Pointeur(njsonn, "/loginAccounts/0/userName")
		pl_LoginAccount("userId") = SLJS_ExtraireValeur_Pointeur(njsonn, "/loginAccounts/0/userId")
		pl_LoginAccount("email") = SLJS_ExtraireValeur_Pointeur(njsonn, "/loginAccounts/0/email")
		' 20210429 MK : Supprimé ligne pour corriger erreur JSON
		'pl_LoginAccount("siteDescription") = SLJS_ExtraireValeur_Pointeur(njsonn, "/loginAccounts/0/siteDescription")
		pl_LoginAccount("authenticationJSON") = |{"Username":"| &amp; pl_LoginAccount("userId") &amp; |","Password":"| &amp; pl_LoginAccount("password") &amp; |","IntegratorKey":"| &amp; pl_LoginAccount("integratorKey") &amp; |"}|

		SLDS_LoginAccount = True
	End If
	
	Exit Function
	
GererErreur:
	Call SIGE_TraiterErreur(gc_TypeElement_SLDS, gc_Element_SLDS, Getthreadinfo(1), "", False)
	Exit Function
End Function


</lotusscript></code><code event="SLDS_Initialisations"><lotusscript>Sub SLDS_Initialisations
	If gns_SLDS Is Nothing Then
		Set gns_SLDS = New NotesSession
		'		Set gndb_SLDS = gns_SLDS.CurrentDatabase
	End If
End Sub





























